# Task Management Backend

Backend API cho hệ thống quản lý công việc, xây dựng bằng Node.js và TypeScript theo kiến trúc Controller → Service → Repository.

## 🚀 Tech Stack

* Node.js
* TypeScript
* Express.js
* PostgreSQL
* TypeORM
* JWT
* Redis
* RabbitMQ
* Socket.IO
* Zod
* Multer
* Docker

## ✨ Features

### Authentication & Authorization

* User registration
* User login
* Access token / Refresh token
* Logout
* Forgot password with OTP
* Reset password
* JWT authentication middleware
* Workspace-based authorization

### Workspace & Project Management

* Workspace membership
* Create project
* Get projects by workspace
* Get project details
* Update project
* Delete project
* Workspace member authorization

### Task Management

* Create and manage tasks
* Task status and priority
* Task assignment
* Due date / start date
* Estimated working hours
* Task position
* Comments and labels support

### File Attachments

* Upload files with Multer
* Project-level attachments
* Task-level attachments
* List attachments by project
* List attachments by task
* Authenticated file download
* Attachment deletion
* Workspace-based access control

### Real-time Chat

* Direct conversations
* Group conversations
* Join / leave conversation rooms
* Send direct messages
* Send group messages
* Retrieve group messages
* Real-time messaging with Socket.IO

### Infrastructure

* Redis for temporary data and OTP storage
* RabbitMQ for asynchronous message processing
* Mail worker for asynchronous email delivery
* Docker / Docker Compose
* Centralized error handling
* Request validation with Zod

